From: SBE1V1K build <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] qca81xx: make local_loopback_get() static

Linux 6.10 enabled -Wmissing-prototypes and OpenWrt builds modules with
-Werror.  qca81xx_phy_local_loopback_get() has no prototype in any header
and is only used to fill the PHY ops table in the same file, exactly like
its static sibling qca81xx_phy_local_loopback_set().

nss_ext/qca81xx_phy.c:83:5: error: no previous prototype for
  'qca81xx_phy_local_loopback_get' [-Werror=missing-prototypes]

--- a/nss_ext/qca81xx_phy.c
+++ b/nss_ext/qca81xx_phy.c
@@ -80,7 +80,7 @@
 	return 0;
 }

-int qca81xx_phy_local_loopback_get(struct nss_phy_device *nss_phydev,
+static int qca81xx_phy_local_loopback_get(struct nss_phy_device *nss_phydev,
 	u32 *enable)
 {
 	int ret;
